WHAT THESE TERMS COVER

This repository holds two kinds of content under two different sets of terms,
and the license below covers only one of them.

The repository's own material is licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License
reproduced below: the export notebooks under notebooks/, the build scripts and
provenance records under scripts/ and sources/, the build lock, the test suites
under tests/, the site shell, and the catalog metadata this project writes.

The prepared datasets under exports-v3/ are not covered by that license. They are
derived from third-party published studies and are redistributed here as
demonstration material. Each generation records its upstream in
exports-v3/<id>/dataset_identity.json under "source": the study name, the URL the
study is published at, and the citation to use. The terms that apply to one of
those datasets are the terms of the study it came from. This project does not
own them and does not restate them here; read them at the upstream study, and
cite that study rather than this repository.

